(2) The vehicle is branded in the specific colour as prescribed by the Ministry;
(3) The driver holds a current certificate issued by the Lagos State Drivers’ Institute in addition to possession of
a valid class “E” driver’s license; and
(4) The vehicle is fitted with a waste basket, fire extinguisher and First Aid box.

