(c) except when overtaking traffic proceeding in the same direction, keep to the right of the road;
(d) when overtaking traffic proceeding in the same direction pass such traffic only on the left or off-side thereof;
(e) whenever necessary, give audible and sufficient warning of approach by sounding the bell, horn or other
